{"surah":104,"verses":{"1":{"phrases":[{"text":"Woe to every backbiter, slanderer","ar":"","head":"","parts":[]}]},"2":{"phrases":[{"text":"who amasses wealth ˹greedily˺ and counts it ˹repeatedly˺","ar":"الَّذِي جَمَعَ مَالًا وَعَدَّدَهُ","head":"","parts":[0]}]},"3":{"phrases":[{"text":"thinking that their wealth will make them immortal","ar":"يَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُ أَخْلَدَهُ","head":"","parts":[0]}]},"4":{"phrases":[{"text":"Not at all!","ar":"","head":"","parts":[]},{"text":"Such a person will certainly be tossed into the Crusher","ar":"","head":"","parts":[]}]},"5":{"phrases":[{"text":"And what will make you realize what the Crusher is","ar":"","head":"","parts":[]}]},"6":{"phrases":[{"text":"˹It is˺ Allah’s kindled Fire","ar":"","head":"","parts":[]}]},"7":{"phrases":[{"text":"which rages over the hearts","ar":"","head":"","parts":[]}]},"8":{"phrases":[{"text":"It will be sealed over them","ar":"","head":"","parts":[]}]},"9":{"phrases":[{"text":"˹tightly secured˺ with long braces","ar":"","head":"","parts":[]}]}}}